# CentCompras core

## Project

Central warehouse + satellite branches. Django 6.1, PostgreSQL, plain HTML/JS. Phases 0–6 are done: catalogue + pricing + purchase orders + goods receipt + manager catalog + branches/requisição/goods issue/branch receipt + **offline catalogue/draft sync/PWA** (review fixes applied). Chrome review **H1–H3 + M1** applied. **Next:** Phase 7 production polish; Phase 8 email (late).

## What exists today

- `accounts` — custom User (email, timezone), warehouse groups, login
- `products` — catalogue + selling prices + `SupplierItemPrice`, staff console `/manage/items/`, manager catalog `/manage/catalog/` (read-only stock + prices)
- `procurement` — purchase orders at `/manage/purchase-orders/`
- `inventory` — goods receipt + `StockMovement` ledger + cached `Item.quantity` at `/manage/goods-receipts/`; goods issue at `/manage/internal-requests/`; FIFO warehouse reservation (`quantity_reserved`, available = on-hand − reserved); branch receipt + branch stock ledger (`BranchStockMovement` + `BranchItemStock`)
- `logging_utils` — rotating logs in `logs/`
- `branches` — tenancy (`Branch`, `BranchMembership`, picker, `/branch/catalog/`) — **built** (Phase 5 ✅)
- `orders` — internal request (requisição interna) — **built** (Phase 5 ✅); warehouse FIFO reservation at approve (D32)
- `threads` — catalogue-gap request threads — **built** (review M/L applied)
- `company_voice` — company-wide suggestion box `/company-voice/` — **built**; review H1/M/L applied (`docs/reviews/company-voice-review-2026-08-24-1010.md`)
- Offline catalogue — **built** (Phase 6 ✅); review P0/P1/P2 applied

## Non-negotiables

- PostgreSQL = source of truth. No client-side writes.
- Business logic in `services.py`; views/commands stay thin
- Warehouse groups (`warehouse_admins`, `warehouse_managers`, `warehouse_data_operators`); `/admin/` is superuser only
- Plain Django + plain JavaScript — no React/Vue
- Incremental phases — no large application dumps
- Do not implement the tenancy-doc `Order` stub (`item_name`)
- Do not start email or shared chrome in passing. **Next is Phase 7** (production deployment / OAuth / shared chrome). Do not start Phase 7 unless that session is requested.
- Do not restyle `/` or polish the staff console unless that session is requested

